<title>USA: SOS Staffing Services to buy Execusoft.</title>
<headline>SOS Staffing Services to buy Execusoft.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY, Utah 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>SOS Staffing Services Inc said on Tuesday that it had signed an agreement to purchase privately held Execusoft Inc, a California information technology staffing company, for an undisclosed dollar amount.</p>
<p>Completion of the acquisition is expected by the end of August, SOS said in a statement.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement were not released, but SOS said that Execusoft's two offices had generated roughly $10 million in revenue over the last 12 months.</p>
</text>
